### =============================================================================
### Multi-Rail Payment Orchestrator & Batch Settlement Engine
### Interactive REST Client Test Suite (VS Code REST Client Extension)
### =============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8010
@bankUrl = http://localhost:8011
@apiKey = sk_live_payment_orchestrator_secret_key_2026

@masterAccountId = a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@payrollAccountId = a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@depletedAccountId = a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004


### =============================================================================
### 1. System Health & Infrastructure Probes
### =============================================================================

### 1.1 Kubernetes Liveness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Kubernetes Readiness Probe (PostgreSQL & RabbitMQ socket verification)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 Partner Bank Simulator Health
GET {{bankUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json


### =============================================================================
### 2. Happy Path: Real-Time Instant Payout (FedNow / RTP)
### =============================================================================

### 2.1 Inspect Master Account Initial Liquidity
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{masterAccountId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 Submit Instant Payout (Captures payment_id dynamically)
# @name createInstantPayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/instant
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "idemp_instant_demo_{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "source_account_id": "{{masterAccountId}}",
  "destination_account_number": "987654321098",
  "destination_routing_number": "021000021",
  "amount": "1500.00",
  "rail": "rtp",
  "description": "Executive vendor milestone settlement"
}

### 2.3 Poll Payment Status & Authoritative Clearing Confirmation
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{createInstantPayment.response.body.payment_id}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.4 Verify Account Debited Correctly
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{masterAccountId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json


