### 3. Idempotency Protection: Duplicate Dispatch Rejection
### =============================================================================

### 3.1 Send First Request with Fixed Idempotency Key
# @name initialIdempotentPayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/instant
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "idemp_fixed_deterministic_test_001",
  "source_account_id": "{{masterAccountId}}",
  "destination_account_number": "987654321098",
  "destination_routing_number": "021000021",
  "amount": "250.00",
  "rail": "fednow",
  "description": "Idempotency test payload"
}

### 3.2 Resend Identical Payload (Must return existing record, zero double debits)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/instant
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "idemp_fixed_deterministic_test_001",
