### 5. Failure & Compensation: Bank Rail Error & Compensating Refund
### =============================================================================

### 5.1 Submit Payment with Invalid Partner Routing (Triggers simulated 502 rejection)
# @name failingPayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/instant
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "idemp_fail_compensation_{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "source_account_id": "{{masterAccountId}}",
  "destination_account_number": "987654321098",
  "destination_routing_number": "999000001",
  "amount": "5000.00",
  "rail": "rtp",
  "description": "Failing transaction triggering compensation"
}

### 5.2 Poll Failed Payment (Status should be 'failed' with error details)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{failingPayment.response.body.payment_id}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### 5.3 Verify Compensating Refund Restored Source Balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{masterAccountId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json


